# Lab Content

## Section order
Shell badge → Why → Live Lab → How → Trade-offs → Verify

## Language
v1 copy: **Korean only** (DECISIONS #5). Separate from main i18n.

## Rules
- Why: strategy rationale, no code required to understand
- How: this repo's implementation, not generic theory
- Verify: reproducible steps (View Source / Network / refresh)
- NO empty placeholder — min 1 real sentence or `TBD: reason`

## Data
`lib/data/portfolio-metrics.ts` SSOT, must match `StatsSection`. Same data across SSR/SSG/ISR/CSR/charts.

## Per-page verify target
| route | proof |
| `/lab/ssr` | metrics+timestamp in View Source |
| `/lab/ssg` | `builtAt` unchanged until redeploy |
| `/lab/isr` | `regeneratedAt` changes after 60s |
| `/lab/csr` | no chart data in View Source; API in Network |
| `/lab/charts` | Recharts x2, `dynamic(ssr: false)` |
| `/lab/3d` | R3F 1 scene; 2D fallback on reduced-motion/WebGL fail |
